-scientist-ai-modelling-3-5-years-only-wolters-kluwer-india-private-limited-pune-69633907",null,"KADZ-gyZSbO10M"],"0x070d8da36330cdcf"]}],"S9P6avnsHqSW4-EPrbrgsQ448":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003ds0mZDPrZACiu-jxfAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_x2NOwoCQRBEMfUIRh2q6K4oBmokCOIPBANDaXeb3ZZxepluf5l38EqexJM4mlTweFVVf9fqyxkawi5j8sZq8Hm-YLqAjeTkHPsCmgPoDuFBGBTEu0frr5zkCBpZVkYIc5HCUWNSmlU6TlNVlxRqaJwlmZxT8XSUexpL-ouDlhiocmh06A9796TyRXu0F2cUT1bucqMAC58zwjbwNWqw5jMb5cAethdPHdhg3EAtLeAX3F7ZEMcAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAow8nxFDhnHWDhA1LpbZYiguRz6V7XGDs7PtVyAjN-Sk3w\u0026source\u003dsh/x/job/li/m1/1#fpstate\u003dtldetail\u0026htivrt\u003djobs\u0026htiq\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003ds0mZDPrZACiu-jxfAAAAAA%3D%3D",null,null,"Data Scientist – AI Modelling (3 -5 years only)",null,null,null,null,1,null,37,["H4sIAAAAAAAA_x2NOwoCQRBEMfUIRh2q6K4oBmokCOIPBANDaXeb3ZZxepluf5l38EqexJM4mlTweFVVf9fqyxkawi5j8sZq8Hm-YLqAjeTkHPsCmgPoDuFBGBTEu0frr5zkCBpZVkYIc5HCUWNSmlU6TlNVlxRqaJwlmZxT8XSUexpL-ouDlhiocmh06A9796TyRXu0F2cUT1bucqMAC58zwjbwNWqw5jMb5cAethdPHdhg3EAtLeAX3F7ZEMcAAAA","v1_Ac3VAow8nxFDhnHWDhA1LpbZYiguRz6V7XGDs7PtVyAjN-Sk3w"]],[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,0]],"S9P6avnsHqSW4-EPrbrgsQ469":[[0,"https://www.foundit.in/job/data-scientist-ai-modelling-3-5-years-only-wolters-kluwer-india-private-limited-pune-69633907","jobs","KADZ-gyZSbO10M","\u003cdiv\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eAbout the Role\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThe FCC DnA team is seeking an experienced Data Scientist to join our AI Modeling team and develop scalable Machine Learning, statistical and AI solutions.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eThis role is ideal for a hands-on Data Scientist who can independently translate business problems into modeling problems, evaluate multiple analytical approaches and recommend solutions based on data, statistical evidence and business requirements.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eYou will work across Statistical Modeling, Machine Learning, NLP and Generative AI while partnering with Product, Engineering and Business teams to take solutions from experimentation toward production.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWe are looking for someone who goes beyond building a model and can clearly explain why a particular modeling approach was selected, how it was validated and what its limitations are.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eKey Responsibilities\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Translate business problems and requirements into appropriate analytical and modeling approaches.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Independently design, develop and evaluate statistical and Machine Learning models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Establish appropriate baseline and challenger models and objectively compare alternative approaches.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Perform exploratory analysis, feature engineering, feature selection and data-quality assessment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Define appropriate model evaluation metrics based on the business problem and the cost of different types of errors.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Apply cross-validation, hyperparameter tuning, out-of-sample testing and other robust validation techniques.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Conduct detailed error analysis, sensitivity analysis and model diagnostics.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Identify and address issues such as data leakage, class imbalance, multicollinearity, sampling bias and overfitting.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Evaluate model explainability, stability and performance trade-offs.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Clearly document model methodology, assumptions, limitations and validation results.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Partner with Engineering and MLOps teams to transition models from experimentation into production.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Support model monitoring, performance tracking and drift analysis after deployment.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Build reusable modeling components and frameworks that can be leveraged across multiple use cases.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Contribute to NLP, Generative AI, RAG and hybrid AI solutions where appropriate.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Mentor junior Data Scientists and conduct code and model reviews.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Communicate modeling recommendations and trade-offs effectively to business, Product and technical stakeholders.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eRequired Qualifications\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eExperience\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Approximately 3-5 years of hands-on experience in Data Science, Machine Learning, Statistical Modeling or Applied AI.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Demonstrated experience independently developing and validating predictive models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience working across the model development lifecycle from data exploration through validation and productionization.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience working with cross-functional Product, Engineering and Business teams.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eStatistical \u0026 Modeling Skills\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Strong understanding of statistical inference, probability, hypothesis testing and experimental design.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Strong hands-on experience with regression, classification, tree-based models, ensemble methods and other Machine Learning techniques.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience with algorithms such as logistic/linear regression, random forest, gradient boosting, XGBoost/LightGBM or comparable techniques.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Strong understanding of feature engineering, feature selection and model diagnostics.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience designing benchmark, baseline and challenger models.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Strong understanding of model evaluation and the ability to select metrics appropriate to the business problem.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Understanding of bias-variance trade-offs, sampling bias, class imbalance, data leakage and model stability.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience with explainability techniques such as feature importance, SHAP or similar approaches.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Ability to assess trade-offs between predictive performance, interpretability, complexity and maintainability.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eTechnical Skills\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Strong Python and modern Data Science ecosystem experience.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Strong SQL and data manipulation skills.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience developing production-quality, reusable modeling code.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Familiarity with APIs and frameworks such as FastAPI.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Familiarity with Git, Docker, CI/CD, cloud platforms such as Azure/AWS and MLOps practices.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience with model deployment, monitoring and versioning is preferred.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Experience with NLP, Generative AI, LLMs, embeddings, RAG or Agentic AI is desirable and will enable contribution across broader AI initiatives.\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eWe Are Looking for Individuals Who\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Ask which modeling approach is most appropriate for the problem and can explain why.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Challenge assumptions rather than automatically selecting the most complex algorithm.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Are comfortable working with ambiguous business problems and defining a structured analytical approach.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Balance experimentation with analytical rigor and production considerations.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Take ownership of modeling workstreams and independently drive them to completion.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Clearly articulate model performance, assumptions, limitations and business implications.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Mentor junior team members and raise the quality of modeling practices around them.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Collaborate effectively with Product, Engineering and business stakeholders.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e. Remain current with developments across statistical modeling, Machine Learning and broader Applied AI.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eEducation\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003eBachelor's or Master's degree in Statistics, Mathematics, Data Science, Computer Science, Artificial Intelligence, Engineering, Economics or another quantitative discipline.\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003ch2\u003eOur Interview Practices\u003c/h2\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\u003c/div\u003e","Data Scientist – AI Modelling (3 -5 years only)",null,null,0,[["organization","Wolters Kluwer India Private Limited"],["organization_mid","/g/11jg3g8x2b"],["publisher_name","Foundit"],["location_feature_id","/google/oyster/feature/0x3bc2bf2e67461101:0x828d43bf9d9ee343"],["cluster_id","0x070d8da36330cdcf"]],0],[null,1,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1],[null,0,null,["organization","organization_mid","publisher_name","location_feature_id","cluster_id"],1,1,1]],"S9P6avnsHqSW4-EPrbrgsQ470":[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,[[15111100,0.62315416,5]]],"S9P6avnsHqSW4-EPrbrgsQ481":[["https://www.google.com/search?ibp\u003dhtl;jobs\u0026q\u003dData+Scientist+in+Pune+with+5+years+of+experience+jobs\u0026htidocid\u003ds0mZDPrZACiu-jxfAAAAAA%3D%3D\u0026hl\u003den-IN\u0026shem\u003depsd1,esd2e,rimspwouoe,sdpie\u0026shndl\u003d37\u0026shmd\u003dH4sIAAAAAAAA_x2NOwoCQRBEMfUIRh2q6K4oBmokCOIPBANDaXeb3ZZxepluf5l38EqexJM4mlTweFVVf9fqyxkawi5j8sZq8Hm-YLqAjeTkHPsCmgPoDuFBGBTEu0frr5zkCBpZVkYIc5HCUWNSmlU6TlNVlxRqaJwlmZxT8XSUexpL-ouDlhiocmh06A9796TyRXu0F2cUT1bucqMAC58zwjbwNWqw5jMb5cAethdPHdhg3EAtLeAX3F7ZEMcAAAA\u0026shmds\u003dv1_Ac3VAow8nxFDhnHWDhA1LpbZYiguRz6V7XGDs7PtVyA